      "writtenOn": "2024-02-22T12:00:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You\u0027re right that current strict use of WillOnce causes the unit tests to be not stable. I agree that order and number of calls is not so important as the result (sysfs entries). I will use ON_CALL where it is possible.\nBut I will need to also use EXPECT_CALL for example for get connector status because the get connector status message is the same each but the replies differ.",
      "parentUuid": "5eea6363_91236406",
      "revId": "288abfa2ee6b8970147181b6eb92b789fbf9dc22",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
