      "writtenOn": "2024-02-22T15:37:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sure but those EXPECT_CALL should be in-line with other things being called in your test.\n\ni.e.\n\n```\nconstexpr int kDefaultPort \u003d 1;\n\nTEST_F(Foo, Bar) {\n  SetupMock();\n  \n  // Trigger a partner connected event. Should result in connector status check\n  // at least twice.\n  EXPECT_CALL(*pd_driver_mock_, \n    ExecuteCmd(_, CommandPortMatches(UCSI_CMD_GET_CONNECTOR_STATUS, kDefaultPort))\n    .WillRepeatedly(Invoke(\u0026kConstatPartnerChange, fptr));\n    .Times(Ge(2));\n    \n  ppm_drv-\u003elpm_alert(ppm_drv-\u003edev, kDefaultPort);\n}\n```",
      "parentUuid": "99a44739_f42e4ee3",
      "revId": "288abfa2ee6b8970147181b6eb92b789fbf9dc22",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
